Hi Teammates this the yolo model training for custom all terrain - to make a own datasheet(project destination) -- Version 9 

STEP 1 : To train the AI model first we have to download or make our data sheet 
    liks for downlaoding the datasheet;
     - [https://rugd.vision/]  or [http://rugd.vision/data/RUGD_frames-with-annotations.zip]
     - [https://universe.roboflow.com/xsianz/offroad-dataset-] or  [https://universe.roboflow.com/mfq/road-obstacle-detection-6zwj5-dassk]
     - [https://roboflow.com/] or [https://universe.roboflow.com/xsianz/offroad-dataset-ii]

STEP 2 : Create a directory , open cmd (cammand prompt) 
 
        cd C:\
        mkdir UGV_Project
        cd UGV_Project
        mkdir V9
        cd V9
        mkdir datasets
        mkdir datasets\raw
        mkdir datasets\processed
        mkdir datasets\object_detection
        mkdir datasets\terrain
        mkdir scripts
        mkdir models
        mkdir results

STEP 3 : Give the each datasheet to it place give its dir [PASTE THE DOWNLOADED DATASHEET IMG & VIDEO INTO ITS DIRECTORY]

    RUGD - C:\UGV_Project\V9\datasets\raw\RUGD
    universi robo flow - C:\UGV_Project\V9\datasets\raw\Road_Obstacle
    roboflow - C:\UGV_Project\V9\datasets\raw\Road_Obstacle
    Off road datasheet 2 - C:\UGV_Project\V9\datasets\raw\Offroad

